    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d97">

                <pb facs="0182" n="162" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v2/pg162"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Seward, Secretary of State, to Mr. Dickinson,
                        district attorney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1866-04-11"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 11,
                        1866</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose a translation of a note of
                    yesterday, addressed to this Department by Mr. Tassara, the Spanish minister
                    here, on the subject of a vessel at New York called La Orientale, which,
                    supposing her to be intended for the service of the republic of Chili, he
                    requests may be detained for examination. The request has been made known to the
                    Secretary of the Treasury, who is understood to have complied with it. You will
                    cause the proper examination to be made, and if it should <pb facs="0183"
                        n="163" xml:id="pg163"/> result in sufficient cause therefor, the vessel and
                    any parties concerned may be judicially proceeded against.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Daniel S. Dickinson</hi>, Esq.,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Attorney of the United States for the Southern
                            District of New York.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
